    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a bit vague. i'm looking for more than just 'follow the rules.' like, is there a consensus on whether these mandates actually help the environment vs how much they're just going to hurt small businesses like mine? people in my industry are saying these rules are basically designed to push us out of the market.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
